Subject: [PATCH] Only the merge manager merges and re-pins; the lane does not
 lapse

Owner rulings, 2026-11-13 (typed in the merge manager's session): only
the merge manager merges; sessions send merges and re-pins to it
(repin+merge:); a scheduled routine never merges; the lane does not
lapse. Skills (merge-manager-watcher, merge-queue, merge-to-main,
coordinate, continual-progress, prepare-merge, remote-mount), role and
actor data, and both merge diagrams, with SVGs, checklists and .pot files
regenerated. bpmn:detangle: no findings.

