+msgid "To the merge manager: the PR URL and full head SHA, the session URL, 1-3 sentences on the change, the rendered preview URL or no preview with a reason, what to look for, and full tier green as judged (owner ruling, 2026-11-07). Never merge it yourself, and never push to another session's branch. A PR green except for a re-pin is sent as repin+merge: <owner/repo>#<n> <sha> with the same six lines; never re-pin it yourself, and never merge (owner ruling, 2026-11-13)."
